    "status": "present",
    "value": "Keep every accepted booking and, separately, every region that is already covered twice. A new event causes a triple booking exactly when it overlaps some double-booked region, so check that list first and reject on any overlap. Otherwise the event is accepted, and its overlap with each existing booking becomes a new double-booked region. Those regions are pairwise disjoint, because if two of them overlapped the shared part would be triple-booked."
  },
